From: Guix channel maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Port the original native terminal facade from GDI to SDL2
Date: 2026-10-15

Keep the five independently resizable cell-grid windows, original text colors,
layout listeners and cyan look cursor. Cache measured SDL_ttf fonts and glyph
masks, retaining dirty cells in software surfaces across native expose events.

